  "forAgencies.featuresCopy": "The infrastructure you need to operate creator, venue, retail, grocery, and service activations from one return-driven workspace.",
  "forAgencies.feat1Title": "God Mode Administration",
  "forAgencies.feat1Desc": "Manage multiple venue and brand clients from a single dashboard. Spin up campaigns in 30 seconds.",
  "forAgencies.feat2Title": "Undeniable ROI",
  "forAgencies.feat2Desc": "Stop selling 'exposure'. Sell verified retail visits, service bookings, grocery activations, and real customer movement to your local clients.",
  "forAgencies.feat3Title": "Automated Recap Reports",
  "forAgencies.feat3Desc": "On Monday morning, hit 'Generate' to download a pristine PDF ROI report to hand to your client.",
  "forAgencies.feat4Title": "Return of Work",
  "forAgencies.feat4Desc": "Differentiate your marketing agency. Show your clients how many people came, acted, returned, created, redeemed, and moved value.",
  "forAgencies.feat5Title": "No-Code Activation Engine",
  "forAgencies.feat5Desc": "Launch referral, purchase, try-on, booking, and visit objectives without writing a single line of code or integrating POS APIs.",
  "forAgencies.feat6Title": "Discover Local Sponsors",
  "forAgencies.feat6Desc": "Use our matchmaking tool to pair your venue clients with aligned brand sponsors automatically.",
  "forAgencies.ctaTitle": "Ready to upgrade your agency?",
  "forAgencies.ctaCopy": "Sign up today and run your first client campaign for free.",
