  "how.pillar1Title": "Verified Foot Traffic",
  "how.pillar1Detail": "Venues and sponsors only pay when patrons physically walk through the door and scan on-site. Zero ad fraud or fake clicks.",
  "how.pillar2Title": "Escrowed Reward Guarantee",
  "how.pillar2Detail": "All bounties, PromoKey tastings, and Gem payouts are pre-funded in secure smart escrows before campaigns go live.",
  "how.pillar3Title": "Weekly Fresh Drops",
  "how.pillar3Detail": "Every week brings new neighborhood debates, fresh food & cocktail drops, and dynamic weekend missions.",
  "how.pillar4Title": "Instant Multi-Currency Payouts",
  "how.pillar4Detail": "Withdrawable USD, spendable Gems, and VIP access passes are delivered directly to your wallet the second proof is confirmed.",
  "how.faqEyebrow": "Got Questions?",
  "how.faqTitle": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "how.faqCopy": "Everything you need to know about participating, redeeming perks, and partnering with Promorang.",
  "how.faq1Q": "Is the PromoCard a credit card or cash balance?",
  "how.faq1A": "No. PromoCard value is a promotional spending allowance for eligible purchases with participating merchants. It is not borrowed money, a deposit account, a general-purpose payment card, or a cash balance. Partner eligibility and purchase terms apply.",
  "how.faq2Q": "Who funds PromoCard value and how does it recharge?",
  "how.faq2A": "Participating merchants define controlled promotional allowances from their offers, while brands may sponsor specific campaigns or recharge opportunities. Eligible verified actions—such as check-ins, reviews, referrals, moments and social shares—can restore available value.",
  "how.faq3Q": "How does Promorang verify I actually visited a venue?",
  "how.faq3A": "We use a dual-layer proof system: on-site countertop QR code scans and GPS geofencing. When you arrive at a partner venue, simply tap Check In and scan the physical counter terminal. The app verifies your location in under 2 seconds.",
  "how.faq4Q": "What is a PromoKey and how do I redeem it?",
  "how.faq4A": "A PromoKey is a digital VIP pass funded by brands and venues. Every Wednesday at 6 PM, limited PromoKeys drop for active community voters. You present the pass on your phone upon arrival to unlock complimentary tastings, secret items, or skip-the-line privileges.",
  "how.faq5Q": "How do cash bounties and Gems work?",
  "how.faq5A": "Cash bounties (USD) are funded rewards for specific actions like attending exclusive drops or creating verified content, and can be withdrawn directly to your bank account or debit card. Gems are spendable platform reward points used in the Rewards Shop for perks, discounts, and merchandise.",
  "how.faq6Q": "How can my restaurant or bar get listed as a venue?",
  "how.faq6A": "Venue registration takes under 5 minutes. You create your venue profile, upload your countertop QR sticker kit, and set available capacity for Friday/Saturday drops. You only pay when verified guests actually visit.",
  "how.faq7Q": "Can creators collaborate directly with local brands?",
  "how.faq7A": "Yes. Creators can browse brand-sponsored bounties in the Growth Hub, attach brand sponsors to their own curated Moments, and earn automated commissions on every follower who attends.",
  "how.explorerEyebrow": "For Explorers & Foodies",
  "how.explorerTitle": "Ready to claim your first VIP tasting?",
  "how.explorerCopy": "Join the Monday debate, unlock Wednesday PromoKeys, and experience your city with instant rewards.",
  "how.startExploring": "Start Exploring",
  "how.voteDiscoveries": "Vote on Discoveries",
  "how.venueEyebrow": "For Venues & Creators",
  "how.venueTitle": "Turn foot traffic into recurring revenue.",
  "how.venueCopy": "Host a drop, claim sponsor bounties, or verify physical visits with zero upfront advertising risk.",
  "how.partnerVenue": "Partner as a Venue",
  "how.creatorHub": "Creator Hub",
