  "economy.overviewEyebrow": "How value moves through Promorang",
  "economy.overviewHeadline": "A closed-loop local economy led by PromoCard spending and verified participation.",
  "economy.overviewSubhead": "PromoCard is the everyday value layer connecting members, merchants, creators and brands. Members use promotional value on eligible partner purchases, merchants gain attributable paying customers, and verified participation can recharge the next purchase.",
  "economy.overviewWhy": "Most loyalty systems begin with abstract points. Promorang begins with a benefit people immediately understand at checkout, then uses proof, standing, PromoKeys, Gems and Pieces as supporting layers for deeper participation.",
  "economy.overviewPrimaryCta": "See the simple flow",
  "economy.overviewSecondaryCta": "Explore brand partnerships",
  "economy.overviewRole1": "Brands & sponsors",
  "economy.overviewRole1Badge": "See what your budget achieves",
  "economy.overviewRole1Why": "Online ads can make it hard to tell whether real people visited or bought something.",
  "economy.overviewRole1Outcome": "Fund real visits, purchases and creator work, then see proof of what happened. Reward money is kept separate and set aside in advance.",
  "economy.overviewRole1Action": "See options for brands",
  "economy.overviewRole2": "Merchants & hosts",
  "economy.overviewRole2Badge": "Bring in customers at the right time",
  "economy.overviewRole2Why": "Businesses need more visits, repeat customers and a practical way to fill quiet periods.",
  "economy.overviewRole2Outcome": "Use check-ins and simple missions to bring people in, reward regulars and create limited event keepsakes.",
  "economy.overviewRole2Action": "See tools for hosts",
  "economy.overviewRole3": "Members & creators",
  "economy.overviewRole3Badge": "Turn participation into useful benefits",
  "economy.overviewRole3Why": "Your time, recommendations and creative work should lead to something you can actually use.",
  "economy.overviewRole3Outcome": "Earn status, sponsor-funded Gems and special access by showing up and contributing—not by paying to get ahead.",
  "economy.overviewRole3Action": "Find things to do",
  "economy.overviewH1Title": "1. Rewards are funded first",
  "economy.overviewH1Desc": "Sponsor money for Gems and prizes is set aside before a reward is offered.",
  "economy.overviewH2Title": "2. Real activity is checked",
  "economy.overviewH2Desc": "Location-aware QR check-ins and receipts help stop bots and fake claims.",
  "economy.overviewH3Title": "3. Points show participation",
  "economy.overviewH3Desc": "Points cannot be traded. You can exchange them for PromoKeys, which are used once to unlock an opportunity.",
  "economy.overviewS1Title": "Merchant & Sponsor Value",
  "economy.overviewS1Text": "Partners define controlled promotional allowances, campaign funding and the purchases or actions that qualify.",
  "economy.overviewS2Title": "PromoCard Purchase",
  "economy.overviewS2Text": "Available card value reduces an eligible bill while the customer pays the remaining amount normally.",
  "economy.overviewS3Title": "Proof, Attribution & Recharge",
  "economy.overviewS3Text": "Receipts and verified activity record who created value and can restore future PromoCard spending capacity.",
  "economy.overviewTagline": "Real-world presence becomes practical spending value, attributable commerce and lasting trust.",
  "economy.pcEyebrow": "The Everyday Value Layer",
  "economy.pcHeadline": "PromoCard turns verified participation into useful local spending value.",
  "economy.pcSubhead": "Eligible members receive a PromoCard with a visible promotional limit. At participating businesses, available PromoCard value reduces an eligible bill and the customer pays the remainder normally. Verified actions can recharge the card for future use.",
  "economy.pcWhy": "Traditional rewards often become abstract points that are difficult to understand or redeem. PromoCard makes the benefit legible at the moment of purchase while giving merchants control over minimum spend, customer limits and promotional exposure.",
  "economy.pcPrimaryCta": "Get Your PromoCard",
  "economy.pcSecondaryCta": "Become a Partner Merchant",
  "economy.pcRole1": "For Members",
  "economy.pcRole1Badge": "Immediate, Visible Savings",
  "economy.pcRole1Why": "People should not need to decode several currencies before receiving a useful benefit.",
  "economy.pcRole1Outcome": "Apply PromoCard value to eligible purchases, pay the remainder normally and see every saving on a clear receipt.",
  "economy.pcRole1Action": "Get Your Card",
  "economy.pcRole2": "For Merchants",
  "economy.pcRole2Badge": "Controlled Promotional Margin",
  "economy.pcRole2Why": "Blanket discounts erode margin without proving whether they created a new or returning customer.",
  "economy.pcRole2Outcome": "Set an allowance, minimum basket and customer cap, then measure the real revenue and visits produced.",
  "economy.pcRole2Action": "Set Merchant Terms",
  "economy.pcRole3": "For Brands, Creators & Communities",
  "economy.pcRole3Badge": "Attributable Customer Movement",
  "economy.pcRole3Why": "Reach and engagement alone do not show whether promotion led to local commerce.",
  "economy.pcRole3Outcome": "Fund recharges or distribute partner offers and connect verified participation to redemption and customer spend.",
  "economy.pcRole3Action": "Explore Partner Options",
  "economy.pcH1Title": "1. Pre-Endowed Promotional Limit",
  "economy.pcH1Desc": "The available amount and cycle are visible before checkout. It is promotional value—not a loan, cash deposit or general-purpose bank card.",
  "economy.pcH2Title": "2. Merchant-Controlled Terms",
  "economy.pcH2Desc": "Participating businesses control eligibility, minimum basket, per-customer allowance and redemption capacity.",
  "economy.pcH3Title": "3. Proof-Based Recharge",
  "economy.pcH3Desc": "Eligible verified check-ins, reviews, referrals, moments and shares can restore available card value.",
  "economy.pcS1Title": "Get your card",
  "economy.pcS1Text": "An eligible Promorang member gets a PromoCard with a clear promotional spending limit.",
  "economy.pcS2Title": "Use it at checkout",
  "economy.pcS2Text": "Available card value lowers an eligible partner bill. You pay the rest as usual.",
  "economy.pcS3Title": "Build up your next benefit",
  "economy.pcS3Text": "Your saving is recorded, and eligible verified activity can restore value for a future purchase.",
  "economy.pcTagline": "Useful to the member. Controlled by the merchant. Measurable for every partner.",
